      "content": "calling them to \"discuss\" it feels useless though. they just give me the same scripted answers every time and then the fees show up again a few days later. it's way more calculated than just a mistake. i need to be more proactive. what kind of defensive financial maneuvers can i take to protect my money from them before they finish this liquidation? i need to stay one step ahead so they cant just drain me.",
